[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-advance-dxc5 7...Bxc5"]
[Name "Advance: 7.dxc5 Bxc5 8.Be3"]

8. Be3 Bxe3 { Takes the bishop: White's queen comes off the d-file and e5 loses a helper. }
9. Qxe3 Ne7 { Heads for f5 or c6. Black is at least level, with a good knight and a weak pawn on e5 to aim at. } *
